{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter's New Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Talking About the Project"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le04ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Giving and Understand Oral Instructions "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Both in the workplace and in our everyday lives, it is important to ask for instructions as well as to give them. <br><br>The chart below summarizes the most important language you can use. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Asking For Instructions</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Giving Instructions</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>How do you (do this)?</li> <li>How do I ... (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">verb</span>) ?</li> <li>What is the best way to ... (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">verb</span>) ?</li> <li>How do I go about it?</li> <li>What do you suggest?</li> <li>Is this about ... ?</li> <li>What do you see me doing ... ?</li> <li>And then?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I would like you to \u2026 (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">verb</span>)</li> <li>In my experience, the best way to do it is by \u2026 </li> <li>You need to \u2026 (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">verb</span>). This is what we call \u2026 I would start by \u2026 (ing)</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Sequencing</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Continuing</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>First, (you) ...</li><li> Then, (you) \u2026 </li><li>Next, (you) \u2026</li><li> Lastly, (you) \u2026 </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Once you've done that, the next thing I want you to do is to \u2026 </li><li>After that, \u2026</li><li> The next step is to ...</li><li> When you finish that, then ...</li><li> The last step is to \u2026 </li><li>The last thing you do is ... </li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">I would like you to</span> find out more about that company."}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">How do I go about</span> do<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> it? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">In my experience, the best way to do it is</span> by scheduling an appointment with them. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">And then</span>? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">After that, I would like you to</span> keep track of their media activity."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking about Work Experience"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " In the Business World, when you are in an interview for a job, it is important to talk about work experience and what you have and haven't done before."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect Tense</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use the Present Perfect (<span class=\"italic\">have</span> + past participle) to describe and talk about experience:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>She <span class=\"strong\">hasn't worked in</span> marketing.</li> <li>She <span class=\"strong\">has worked in</span> a few PR companies.</li> <li><span class=\"strong\">Have</span> you us<span class=\"strong\">ed</span> this software before?</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have experience of / with</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also talk about experience using the expression have experience of:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>I<span class=\"strong\"> have a lot of experience of</span> work<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> with customers.</li> <li>I <span class=\"strong\">have no experience with</span> advertising.</li> <li>Do you <span class=\"strong\">have any experience of</span> deal<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> with clients?</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Be Familiar with</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also use the expression \u201cbe familiar with\u201d to describe something you know because you learned about it or experienced it before. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li><span class=\"strong\">Are</span> you <span class=\"strong\">familiar with</span> this particular software?</li> <li>She'<span class=\"strong\">s familiar  with</span> the problems we're having.</li></ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "consultant"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone whose job is to give advice on a particular subject"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have worked as a PR consultant before."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when talking about work experience. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rundown"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a quick report or explanation of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like to give you a rundown of this new assignment."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " project "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a carefully planned piece of work to do something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This is a major project for our firm."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to embark on  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to start something new"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are about to embark on an exciting journey."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "public image "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the ideas and opinions that the public has about a person or an organization  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They want to improve their public image."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "publicity"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " attention in magazines, newspapers, or television "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need to create publicity for their new clothing line. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob03aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to keep track of"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be fully aware; to be informed of  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to keep track of their social media. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob03aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of 5 jobs. Write each job down on a piece of paper."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For each job, think of the kind of work experience that someone that has the job would have. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 2 sentences related to work experience for each on a separate piece of paper."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Place the papers upside down so you can't see the words or sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Turn one paper over to see the word or sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Turn another paper over. If they are a match, you take the par. If they are not a match, you place them upside down again."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Continue until all the papers are taken."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write down the names of different jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about work experience."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I match a job with its experience."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can talk about work experience.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can give and understand oral instructions."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "  Do you work? Where? What do you do? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What kind of work experience do you have?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area",