: "0", "image": "engenn6le04ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le04ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Miranda, before we start, I would like to ask about your experience. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I have worked as a PR consultant before, and have some experience of working with clients internationally.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Excellent. I would like to give you a rundown on this major project we are about to embark on. Have you read the memo I sent?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I haven't read it yet, but I scanned through it briefly. Is this about Holly's?"}, {"time": "24000", "image": "engenn6le04ob03re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Correct! They've decided to hire an agency to improve their public image as well as creating publicity for their new clothing line.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Sounds exciting. What exactly do you see me doing on this project?  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I would like you to do some research on Farmani. In my experience, the best way to do it is by setting up an appointment with him.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: OK. I can do that. And then?"}, {"time": "47300", "image": "engenn6le04ob03re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Once you've done that, the next thing I want you to do is find out as much as you can about Holly's.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>:  Got it. How do I go about that?  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: You need to keep track of their social media. This is what we call monitoring coverage. We use it to get a better insight into the company's image.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Gotcha! I'm going to get started on this right away."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}